  "zh": "# 今日AI与科技领域频发重大进展，金融政策与国际安全亦成焦点\n## AI 与科技\n- **OpenAI全面上线GPT-6**：OpenAI正式发布最新一代GPT-6模型，性能显著提升。\n- **Claude Haiku 5.5发布**：Anthropic推出Claude Haiku 5.5版本，推理速度与成本均有优化。\n- **OpenAI AI数学进展**：OpenAI分享AI在数学证明与问题求解方面的最新突破。\n- **Meta微软限制Claude使用**：Meta与微软采取措施限制员工内部使用Claude AI以降低风险。\n## 行业动向\n- **南亚科技上调DRAM合同价**：南亚科技宣布上调DRAM合同价，反映内存市场供需紧张。\n- **人民银行12000亿买断式逆回购**：央行宣布12000亿买断式逆回购操作，以维持银行体系流动性。\n## 国际视野\n- **五角大楼指示美军备战对伊朗**：美国国防部下令美军加强对伊朗的军事准备与演练。\n- **伊朗F-5战机贴脸袭击美军基地**：伊朗F-5战机实施贴脸式低空袭击，引发美军基地安全警觉。",
  "en": "# Today’s AI and tech sector sees major breakthroughs, while financial policy and international security remain focal points.\n## AI & Tech\n- **OpenAI launches GPT-6**：OpenAI’s newest GPT-6 model delivers notable performance gains across language tasks.\n- **Claude Haiku 5.5 released**：Anthropic’s Claude Haiku 5.5 update improves inference speed and lowers cost.\n- **OpenAI shares AI math progress**：OpenAI reveals breakthroughs in AI‑driven mathematical reasoning and proof‑assistance.\n- **Meta Microsoft Claude**：Meta and Microsoft curb internal Claude AI use to mitigate security and compliance risks.\n## Industry Moves\n- **South Asia tech raises DRAM price**：South Asian DRAM suppliers lift contract prices, signaling tightening memory supply.\n- **People's Bank of China 1200bn reverse repo**：The PBOC injects 1.2 trillion yuan via reverse repo to sustain banking liquidity.\n## Global Outlook\n- **Pentagon orders US troops ready for Iran**：The Pentagon directs US forces to heighten readiness for possible Iran‑related operations.\n- **Iran F-5 jets strike US base**：Iranian F‑5 fighters conduct low‑altitude “buzz‑by” flights over a US installation, raising alert levels."
